# Integration Task 5, round 3 — root-level .gitignore. The existing
# .gitignore lives at grovyn-core-platform/.gitignore and only covers paths
# under that directory; docker-compose.yml, .env, deployment/, and backups/
# all live at the true repo root (one level above), which needed its own
# coverage -- a real gap found while verifying nothing from this task's
# testing would end up staged.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# pg_dump output (Integration Task 6) -- real tenant data, never committed.
backups/
